        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40825"/>
        <updated>2025-08-21T23:51:12.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">This PR addresses the feedback originally posted by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/carlosjeurissen/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/carlosjeurissen">@carlosjeurissen</a> in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="2819768304" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/25808" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25808/hovercard?comment_id=2627793381&amp;comment_type=issue_comment" href="https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/25808#issuecomment-2627793381">mdn/browser-compat-data#25808 (comment)</a></p>
<blockquote>
<p dir="auto"><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/rebloor/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/rebloor">@rebloor</a> can we add a note stating Firefox does not support generating a <code class="notranslate">service_worker</code> based in the <code class="notranslate">scripts</code> key? This is something currently only supported by Apple.</p>
</blockquote>
<h4 dir="auto">Related issues</h4>
